[36m(main_task pid=588366)[0m Step 1: Calculate the total number of students in both grades.
[36m(main_task pid=588366)[0m Total students = 520 (7th grade) + 650 (8th grade) = 1170 students
[36m(main_task pid=588366)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=588366)[0m Step 2: Divide the total number of students by the total number of representatives.
[36m(main_task pid=588366)[0m Number of representatives = Total students / Total representatives
[36m(main_task pid=588366)[0m Number of representatives = 1170 / 18
